      smallTalk:
      - personality: anxious
        premade: 
        kinds: 000000000100000002000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.anxious.1
          text: I read one sneeze in the past can delete a whole family tree. Is
            that true?
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: sunny
        premade: 
        kinds: 000000000100000002000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.sunny.1
          text: My whole block got frozen in default! Everyone's home all day now!
            So cosy!
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: stickler
        premade: 
        kinds: 03000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.stickler.1
          text: I've read all your forms. Four days in the intake hall. Two have
            typos.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: glum
        premade: 
        kinds: 000000000100000002000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.glum.1
          text: The maglev was late. So was my pay. So, apparently, was my birth.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: 
        premade: gutenberg
        kinds: 
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.gutenberg.1
          text: My business in Strasbourg is private. It involves letters. Movable
            ones.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: chatty
        premade: 
        kinds: 000000000100000002000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.chatty.1
          text: My neighbour went to the past last year. Came back with a tan and
            a curse.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: chatty
        premade: 
        kinds: 03000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.chatty.2
          text: The man next to me in the intake hall snores in three tongues.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: curt
        premade: 
        kinds: 000000000100000002000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.curt.1
          text: Queue's billed by the minute. This is costing us both.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: curt
        premade: 
        kinds: 03000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.curt.2
          text: Four days in the intake hall. Food's grey. Chairs are grey.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: anxious
        premade: 
        kinds: 03000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.anxious.2
          text: The intake hall has no windows. Is the sky still up there? Is it
            staying up?
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: sunny
        premade: 
        kinds: 03000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.sunny.2
          text: The intake hall has free soup! Grey soup, but free!
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
      - personality: grand
        premade: 
        kinds: 000000000100000002000000
        era: 
        key: 
        variant: 0
        verdict: 0
        intent: 0
        reason: 
        lie: 
        outcome: 0
        line:
          id: interview.voices.smallTalk.grand.1
          text: The maglev had no first class. I stood. Like a statue. A noble one.
        then:
          id: 
          text: 
