    waiverRefusal: 0.05
    confess: 0.6
    strandingFate: News
  - id: curt
    name: Curt
    weight: 1
    note: Time is money, and in 2150 the queue bills by the minute.
    waiverRefusal: 0.3
    confess: 0.3
    strandingFate: 
  - id: anxious
    name: Anxious
    weight: 1
    note: Worried about paradoxes, transponders, butterflies and you.
    waiverRefusal: 0.05
    confess: 0.8
    strandingFate: Forgotten
  - id: sunny
    name: Sunny
    weight: 1
